  journalLore: Old guardians of the forest, set there to keep it. They are still keeping it. They just no longer know what from.
  journalAdvice: Slow and heavy, and its sweeping blows are telegraphed long before they land, so there is time to read them. It can call roots from the ground. Only open to a backstab while staggered, so wear down its poise first.
  journalHabitat: The old root paths, standing where it was told to stand
